<title>AUSTRIA: Czech coach in fatal crash in Austria.</title>
<headline>Czech coach in fatal crash in Austria.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Czech coach crashed and burst into flames on a southern Austrian motorway early on Saturday, killing one person and injuring 15, police said.</p>
<p>Austrian television said the coach, which was carrying 45, was en route from the Czech Republic to Italy when the accident occurred near Steinberg, 200 km southwest of Vienna.</p>
